{"reference":"Genesis 17","book":"Genesis","chapter":17,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"Abraham's seed and promise","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Galatians rereads Genesis by concluding that those belonging to Messiah are Abraham's seed and heirs according to promise. The supplied scriptural evidence means Roman household law should not become the sole source for the heir and kinship language; this remains a disputed interpretation of Genesis's reception.","verse_refs":["Genesis 17:1-8"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_genesis_017_1686db0b9b5858fab96d72ac"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}
